    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d308">

                <pb facs="0544" n="528" xml:id="pg528"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.50/6–2749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Embassy in Iran
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-27T19:00:00-04:00">May 27, 1949—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>488. On instruction FonMin, Ala today conveyed his Govt’s desire immediate US
                    econ assistance to tune 500 million dollars for urgent rehabilitation 1941 level
                    Iran economy. He stated understanding question had been discussed with Wiley who
                    wld transmit request with his blessing. We indicated inability cope with vague
                    request of such proportions. Ala said he had asked Tehran more details.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
